### Blog posts — same workflow surface as pages (see pages-api.http) plus categories.

### List published posts
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/posts?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}&status=PUBLISHED
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

### Create a post
POST {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/posts?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

{
  "slug": "quarterly-supply-budget",
  "heroMediaId": null,
  "categoryIds": [],
  "tags": ["budgeting", "b2b"],
  "authorName": "Maya Chen",
  "featured": true,
  "translations": [
    {"language": "en", "title": "How to plan a quarterly supply budget", "excerpt": "A short guide.", "body": "<p>…</p>", "metaDescription": "Plan your quarter."}
  ]
}

### Schedule it
POST {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/posts/1/publish?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

{"publishAt": "2026-12-09T09:00:00Z"}

### Categories
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/posts/categories?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

###
POST {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/posts/categories?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

{"slug": "guides", "names": {"en": "Guides", "ar": "أدلة"}, "position": 0}
